%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dEh? Eh?\d%K%P
「额、诶？」%K%P
Did I just make a fool out of myself?%K%P
难道说，\n我又搞砸了？%K%P
Was I the kind of pathetic sap who read too much into a\nsimple joke?%K%P
将麻实的客套话往好的方向过度理解了，\n真以为她在邀请我上楼喝茶。我就是个悲剧男…？%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI-I'm sorry... that totally flew over my head.\nYeah... I guess it was pretty silly of me to actually...\d%K%P
「抱、抱歉…是我没看气氛。\n也是啊，那样的事想想也不可能…」%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dAaahh?!\nNo! Wait! Wrong! That's good!\d%K%P
