%LCOsamu
%LC理
\d...It is?\d%K%P
「…理解的不对，反而好？」%K%P
So she was basically confirming it was a misunderstanding\non my part...?%K%P
这意思是说，我的错误理解反而是正确的…？%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dI didn't mean it like that... Ah, damn it all! Why do you\nhave to be such a milksop all the time?!\d%K%P
「也不是那个意思…啊啊够了！\n你怎么老是这么低三下四的！」%K%P
%LCOsamu
%LC理
\dI-I'm sorry... I have no excuses...\d%K%P
「抱、抱歉…很对不起…」%K%P
Screaming at a timid person wouldn't make him any more\ncourageous, though. ...Still, the fact I could only make\nretorts in my mind was proof enough of my timidness.%K%P
对着低三下四的人如此怒吼，我觉得反而会起到反效果。\n…而且，在心中这样的反驳更加让我觉得自己低三下四了。%K%P
%LCAsami
%LC麻实
\dIt's not like that!\nPlease calm down! Or rather, I should calm down!\d%K%P
